---
source: crates/vize/src/cli.rs
expression: normalize_help(help)
---
High-performance Vue.js toolchain in Rust

Usage: vize [COMMAND]

Commands:
  build           Compile Vue SFC files (default command) [alias: atelier]
  fmt             Format Vue, JSX, and TSX files [alias: glyph]
  lint            Lint Vue, HTML, JSX, and TSX files [alias: patina]
  check           Type check Vue, JSX, and TSX files
  inspector       Create playground compiler inspector payloads and agent reports
  curator         Curator utilities for diagnostics and reports
  doctor          Analyze whole-application health
  clean           Remove Vize-generated cache artifacts
  check-server    Start type check JSON-RPC server (Unix only)
  content-mapper  Start the TypeScript content-mapper protocol server
  musea           Start component gallery server
  lsp             Start Language Server Protocol server [alias: maestro]
  ide             IDE integration - LSP server and editor extension management
  upgrade         Update the installed Vize package [alias: self-update]
  ready           Run fmt, lint, check, and build
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --version
          Print version

  -h, --help
          Print help
